(`install-if/the-names-a-condition-states-number-nothing`), which reaches
`so:libKF6Wallet.so.6` first, and apk installs `kwallet` alone. The shape
of `pimcommon-takes-kwallet-alone`; contrast
`neochat-takes-kwallet-alone`.

